[b]Skip Space Travel — development draft[/b]

Tested in-game on outbound/return round trips from both the undocked Den and
Kafrene. Not yet published as a Nexus listing.

[b]What it does[/b]
[list]
[*]Skip leaving the Den, the hyperspace intro, and approaching the planet before missions.
[*]Skip leaving the planet, the hyperspace intro, approaching the Den, and docking after missions.
[*]Preserve mission loading, results, rewards, and input restoration.
[*]Leave unrelated story scenes and conversations unchanged.
[/list]

The hyperspace loop still plays while the destination loads; loading time itself cannot be removed.

